---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';

const articleLD = JSON.stringify({
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@type": "Article",
  "headline": "BirkyStudio vs B.Claw (Bounti): An AI That Drafts Your Inbox vs a Front Desk That Answers",
  "description": "Honest head-to-head comparison of BirkyStudio vs B.Claw by Bounti for real estate agents. B.Claw publishes every price, from a free trial to Start $99, Light $219, Medium $349 and Heavy $599 a month, month to month with no lock-in, but it works inside your inbox, calendar and CRM and it does not answer a phone call or a WhatsApp message. BirkyStudio answers your phone and WhatsApp 24/7 in English and Spanish, follows up automatically, and sells once instead of monthly. Real pricing, real limits, no bias.",
  "author": {
    "@type": "Person",
    "name": "Luna Jerney",
    "url": "https://birkystudio.com"
  },
  "publisher": {
    "@type": "Organization",
    "name": "Birky Studio",
    "url": "https://birkystudio.com",
    "logo": {
      "@type": "ImageObject",
      "url": "https://birkystudio.com/images/birky-logo.jpg"
    }
  },
  "datePublished": "2026-11-17",
  "dateModified": "2026-11-17"
});

const faqLD = JSON.stringify({
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@type": "FAQPage",
  "mainEntity": [
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "How much does B.Claw cost?",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "B.Claw publishes all of its prices, which is better than most of its competitors. The free plan runs about a week of real use with no credit card, and then Start is $99 a month for roughly 100 actions, Light is $219 a month for roughly 240 actions, Medium is $349 a month for 40 or more actions a day, and Heavy is $599 a month for 80 or more actions a day. Every plan includes every feature, and the only difference is how much the agent runs. Plans are month to month with no annual lock-in and no setup fee, upgrades are prorated, downgrades take effect at the next cycle, and top-ups come in $5 increments inside a comfort zone you set, which defaults to your plan plus $50. Year one on Light is about $2,628, and Medium, the plan described as most popular for agents doing three to five deals a month, is about $4,188."
      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "Does B.Claw answer my phone or reply on WhatsApp?",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "No, and this is the single most important thing to understand about it. B.Claw is an AI agent that works inside your Gmail, your calendar and your CRM. It drafts replies for your approval, pulls MLS comps for a CMA, writes listing content, stages listing photos, runs a morning briefing and keeps a memory of every promise you made. What it does not do is pick up a phone call or hold a WhatsApp conversation, and Bounti does not claim otherwise. Its own pricing page says every plan gets the whole agent: briefings, triage, CMAs, listing prep, memory and standing orders. Answering calls and messages is a different product, and that product is BirkyStudio's: the Voice Receptionist is $550 one-time plus Vapi usage of about $30 to $50 a month and answers calls 24/7 in English and Spanish, and the WhatsApp Text Receptionist is $297 one-time."
      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "How is B.Claw different from BirkyStudio's The Base Agent?",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "They are both an AI layer that works across your tools, which is why this page pairs them. The difference is who does the work and when it stops. B.Claw is a subscription you operate: it drafts, you approve, you send, and the bill continues for as long as you want it. It runs from $99 to $599 a month forever, so $1,188 to $7,188 a year, every year. The Base Agent is a build we do for you one time for $1,297, with the Notion CRM included free, and after that the only optional cost is care at $97 a month. On the plans an agent actually runs daily, Light at $2,628 a year and Medium at $4,188 a year each cost more in year one than The Base Agent plus a year of care at about $2,461, and unlike a one-time build the subscription never ends."
      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "Is B.Claw (Bounti) the same as OpenClaw or other Claw tools?",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "No, and the names do get mixed up. B.Claw is the name of the AI agent sold by Bounti, a company whose product is built specifically around the real estate agent workflow: Gmail, Google Calendar, MLS comps, CMAs, listings and 250 or more connected tools. OpenClaw is an unrelated open-source project that runs on a server you host and maintain yourself, which is why the agents discussing it in forums talk about VPS and AWS upkeep and about rebuilding integrations that established automation platforms already provide. So when you read a forum thread about Claw, check which product is actually being discussed before you take the opinion as a review of Bounti. The two are not the same purchase and the support experience is not comparable either, because one is a hosted product with a vendor behind it and the other is software you run."
      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "Does B.Claw have a contract, a setup fee or a free trial?",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "This is where B.Claw is genuinely clean, and it is worth saying clearly. There is a free trial of about a week with no credit card and every feature included, there is no setup fee, every plan is month to month with no annual lock-in, upgrades are prorated, and there is no cancellation penalty. Its own pricing page states there are no annual or volume discounts because pricing is the same month to month for everyone, with no negotiated rates. That is a fairer buying experience than BoldTrail, CINC or Sierra Interactive, all of which hide the price or lock you into twelve months. BirkyStudio is also contract free with no minimum term and a 30 day money back guarantee on the build, and the pattern across both products is that the cheapest thing to compare is not the monthly number but the exit."
      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "Does B.Claw include an IDX website or lead generation?",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "No. B.Claw rides on the real estate stack you already pay for rather than replacing it, and its own comparison page is explicit that it has no IDX website, describing it as riding on your existing IDX. It also does not supply leads. What it does is work the leads and the listings you already have: it drafts every reply for approval, triggers instant response on a new lead, prepares CMAs from your MLS comps, and updates a pipeline sheet from your inbox. If you need an IDX site, that comes from a platform such as BoldTrail, Sierra Interactive or Placester, or from your MLS website vendor. BirkyStudio is in a third category again: we build general business websites at $499, $999 and $1,999 one-time, and our Verified Prospect List at $497 or $997 one-time is a file of verified, enriched, scored prospects you own, not an IDX feed."
      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "Is B.Claw a good fit for a team or a brokerage?",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "Not today, and Bounti says so itself. Its pricing FAQ answers the team question directly: not yet, B.Claw is a single-agent product today, each agent runs their own subscription with their own Gmail, calendar and CRM connections, and multi-agent, shared inbox and brokerage tiers are on the roadmap but not shipping. So a five person team is five subscriptions at $99 to $599 each per month, which is $5,940 to $35,940 a year, with no shared inbox and no brokerage roll-up. BirkyStudio's business tier starts at $2,997 one-time for The Base Agent and does not multiply by seat. For a brokerage that wants one system for IDX, lead routing, commissions and recruiting, neither of these is the answer and a platform such as BoldTrail is."
      }
    }
  ]
});
---

<BaseLayout
  title="BirkyStudio vs B.Claw (Bounti) 2026"
  description="Honest 2026 comparison: B.Claw publishes every price but works in your inbox and never answers a call. BirkyStudio answers your phone and WhatsApp 24/7."
  image="/images/comparison/bclaw.jpg"
  >
    <script type="application/ld+json" set:html={articleLD} />
    <script type="application/ld+json" set:html={faqLD} />

    <!-- Hero -->
    <section style="padding:100px 0 80px;position:relative;overflow:hidden">
    <div style="max-width:900px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 32px;position:relative;z-index:1;">
      <div style="display:inline-block;padding:8px 20px;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.1);border-radius:100px;color:white;font-size:0.85rem;font-weight:500;margin-bottom:20px;">
        Updated November 2026 • Honest comparison
      </div>
      <h1 style="font-size:clamp(1.8rem,4vw,3rem);font-weight:800;color:white;margin-bottom:20px;line-height:1.15;">
        BirkyStudio vs B.Claw (Bounti)<br>
        <span style="background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--bs-accent),var(--bs-accent));-webkit-background-clip:text;-webkit-text-fill-color:transparent;">An AI That Drafts Your Inbox vs a Front Desk That Answers</span>
      </h1>
      <p style="font-size:1.1rem;color:var(--bs-text);line-height:1.8;max-width:700px;">
        B.Claw by Bounti is the most transparent AI agent in real estate right now. It publishes a free trial with no card, four plans from $99 to $599 a month, month to month with no lock-in and no setup fee, and it genuinely does the work: morning briefings, inbox triage, replies drafted in your voice, CMAs from your MLS comps, listing content, virtual staging, and 250 or more connected tools riding on top of the CRM you already pay for. It is also the competitor we agree with most, which is exactly why the limit matters: nothing in it picks up a phone call or holds a WhatsApp conversation, and you are the one who approves and sends everything. BirkyStudio is the other half. Here is the honest breakdown, including every place B.Claw is the better buy.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Main Content -->
  <section style="padding:80px 0">
    <div style="max-width:900px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 32px;">

      <!-- Quick Answer -->
      <div style="background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--bs-bg-raised),var(--bs-bg-raised));border-radius:16px;padding:32px;margin-bottom:64px;border:1px solid rgba(255,45,149,0.3);">
        <h2 style="color:white;font-size:1.3rem;margin-bottom:16px;">⚡ Quick Answer</h2>
        <p style="color:var(--bs-text);line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:16px;">
          <strong style="color:white;">Choose B.Claw if:</strong> You want an AI working across the software you already pay for, you want to see every price before you speak to anyone, and you want a free trial with no card. Especially if you already live in Gmail and you want your email replies drafted, your CMAs prepared from your MLS comps, your listings written and staged, and a briefing on your phone at 6:30am. Entry is $99 a month, the whole agent is on every plan, and you can leave whenever you like.<br><br>
          <strong style="color:white;">Choose BirkyStudio if:</strong> The problem is that nobody answers. A lead calls at 9pm and reaches voicemail. A buyer writes on WhatsApp on a Sunday and hears nothing until Tuesday. You want the phone and the messages answered in seconds, in English and Spanish, around the clock, you want follow-up to happen without you working a list, and you would rather pay $297 to $1,297 once than $99 to $599 a month forever.<br><br>
          <strong style="color:white;">The honest difference:</strong> B.Claw makes you faster at the work you already do. BirkyStudio does the work nobody is awake for. B.Claw is cheaper to try and easier to walk away from. BirkyStudio is cheaper after the first year, and it is the only one of the two that answers a ringing phone, which is the moment most leads are actually won or lost.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Article Image 1 -->
      <div style="text-align:center;margin-bottom:64px;">
        <img src="/images/comparison/bclaw-article-1.jpg" alt="Wide view of a bright modern real estate brokerage office interior with several empty workstations, tall windows, plants and warm morning light" style="width:100%;max-width:800px;border-radius:12px;height:auto;box-shadow:0 4px 24px rgba(0,0,0,0.3);" loading="lazy">
      </div>

      <!-- Why Compare -->
      <h2 style="font-size:1.6rem;font-weight:700;color:white;margin-bottom:16px;">Why compare BirkyStudio and B.Claw?</h2>
      <p style="color:var(--bs-text);line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:16px;">
        Most comparison pages on this site weigh a platform against a front desk. This one is different, because B.Claw is the closest product to what we build: an AI agent that reads your real inbox, your calendar, your MLS and your CRM and takes actions across them. Bounti sells it to real estate agents with a working pitch, published prices and a free trial, and it connects to 250 or more tools so you do not have to rip out the stack you already run. Bounti also sells the visual side of the same platform, which is how a lot of agents first meet the company: photo tools that turn empty room shots into staged listings, listing videos with voiceover, and marketing kits with flyers and social posts.
      </p>
      <p style="color:var(--bs-text);line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:16px;">
        BirkyStudio takes a narrower route. The Base Agent, at $1,297 one time with a Notion CRM for agents included free, reads every website and WhatsApp enquiry, sorts it, saves it, answers it instantly and follows up automatically in English and Spanish. Add the AI Receptionist and the phone itself is answered around the clock: $297 one time for WhatsApp, $550 one time for voice plus Vapi usage of about $30 to $50 a month. Add a Verified Prospect List at $497 or $997 one time and you start from real, enriched, scored prospects you own rather than a rented stream.
      </p>
      <p style="color:var(--bs-text);line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:40px;">
        So the real question is not which product is better built. Both are well built, and B.Claw is the more transparent of the two on price. The question is what kind of help you actually need: a faster version of you, or somebody standing at the door while you sleep. That is what the tables below compare, and we have written down the parts where B.Claw wins, because there are several.
      </p>

      <!-- Comparison Table -->
      <h2 id="comparison" style="font-size:1.6rem;font-weight:700;color:white;margin-bottom:24px;">BirkyStudio vs B.Claw, Side by Side</h2>
      <div style="overflow-x:auto;margin-bottom:64px;">
        <table style="width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:0.9rem;">
          <thead>
            <tr style="border-bottom:2px solid var(--bs-accent);">
              <th style="text-align:left;padding:14px 12px;color:var(--bs-accent);font-weight:600;">Feature</th>
              <th style="text-align:left;padding:14px 12px;color:var(--bs-accent);font-weight:600;">BirkyStudio</th>
              <th style="text-align:left;padding:14px 12px;color:var(--bs-accent);font-weight:600;">B.Claw (Bounti)</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            <tr style="border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);">
              <td style="padding:14px 12px;color:white;font-weight:600;">Starting Price</td>
              <td style="padding:14px 12px;color:white;font-weight:600;">$0 15-minute audit, projects from $297 one-time</td>
              <td style="padding:14px 12px;color:white;font-weight:600;">✅ Free trial about a week, no card, then $99/mo (Start)</td>
            </tr>
            <tr style="border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);background:rgba(255,255,255,0.02);">
              <td style="padding:14px 12px;color:white;font-weight:600;">What It Is</td>
              <td style="padding:14px 12px;color:white;font-weight:600;">A done-for-you AI operator we build and run for you</td>
              <td style="padding:14px 12px;color:white;font-weight:600;">An AI agent you subscribe to and operate in your own tools</td>
            </tr>
            <tr style="border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);">
              <td style="padding:14px 12px;color:white;font-weight:600;">Price Visible Before a Sales Call</td>
              <td style="padding:14px 12px;color:white;font-weight:600;">✅ Yes, every price is published on our site</td>
              <td style="padding:14px 12px;color:white;font-weight:600;">✅ Yes, every plan and every limit is published</td>
            </tr>
            <tr style="border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);background:rgba(255,255,255,0.02);">
              <td style="padding:14px 12px;color:white;font-weight:600;">Pricing Model</td>
              <td style="padding:14px 12px;color:white;font-weight:600;">✅ One-time build you own, optional $97/mo or $197/mo care</td>
              <td style="padding:14px 12px;color:white;font-weight:600;">⚠️ Monthly subscription forever, $99 to $599/mo</td>
            </tr>
            <tr style="border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);">
              <td style="padding:14px 12px;color:white;font-weight:600;">Contract Commitment</td>
              <td style="padding:14px 12px;color:white;font-weight:600;">✅ No contract, no minimum term, 30-day money-back on the build</td>
              <td style="padding:14px 12px;color:white;font-weight:600;">✅ Month to month, no annual lock-in, upgrades prorated</td>
            </tr>
            <tr style="border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);background:rgba(255,255,255,0.02);">
              <td style="padding:14px 12px;color:white;font-weight:600;">Free Trial</td>
              <td style="padding:14px 12px;color:white;font-weight:600;">✅ Free 15-minute audit, 30-day money-back guarantee</td>
              <td style="padding:14px 12px;color:white;font-weight:600;">✅ About a week of full use, every feature, no credit card</td>
            </tr>
            <tr style="border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);">
              <td style="padding:14px 12px;color:white;font-weight:600;">Answers Your Phone (AI Voice)</td>
              <td style="padding:14px 12px;color:white;font-weight:600;">✅ AI Voice Receptionist $550 one-time (Vapi ~$30-50/mo), 24/7 EN and ES</td>
              <td style="padding:14px 12px;color:white;font-weight:600;">❌ No, it does not answer calls at all</td>
            </tr>
            <tr style="border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);background:rgba(255,255,255,0.02);">
              <td style="padding:14px 12px;color:white;font-weight:600;">AI Conversations on WhatsApp</td>
              <td style="padding:14px 12px;color:white;font-weight:600;">✅ Text Receptionist $297 one-time, full AI conversations</td>
              <td style="padding:14px 12px;color:white;font-weight:600;">❌ No WhatsApp agent</td>
            </tr>
            <tr style="border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);">
              <td style="padding:14px 12px;color:white;font-weight:600;">AI Follow-Up on Leads</td>
              <td style="padding:14px 12px;color:white;font-weight:600;">✅ Included with The Base Agent, sends without you touching it</td>
              <td style="padding:14px 12px;color:white;font-weight:600;">⚠️ Yes, but as drafts you approve and send yourself</td>
            </tr>
            <tr style="border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);background:rgba(255,255,255,0.02);">
              <td style="padding:14px 12px;color:white;font-weight:600;">Email Inbox Triage and Draft Replies</td>
              <td style="padding:14px 12px;color:white;font-weight:600;">⚠️ Enquiries are read, sorted, answered and saved, not drafted for approval</td>
              <td style="padding:14px 12px;color:white;font-weight:600;">✅ Yes, drafts in your voice, one-tap approval, nothing sends without you</td>
            </tr>
            <tr style="border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);">
              <td style="padding:14px 12px;color:white;font-weight:600;">Morning Briefing</td>
              <td style="padding:14px 12px;color:white;font-weight:600;">❌ Not a scheduled daily brief</td>
              <td style="padding:14px 12px;color:white;font-weight:600;">✅ Yes, a 6:30am brief with calendar, urgent mail and pipeline</td>
            </tr>
            <tr style="border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);background:rgba(255,255,255,0.02);">
              <td style="padding:14px 12px;color:white;font-weight:600;">CMA Preparation</td>
              <td style="padding:14px 12px;color:white;font-weight:600;">❌ Not offered</td>
              <td style="padding:14px 12px;color:white;font-weight:600;">✅ Yes, MLS comps pulled and adjusted into a branded CMA</td>
            </tr>
            <tr style="border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);">
              <td style="padding:14px 12px;color:white;font-weight:600;">Listing Content and Photo Staging</td>
              <td style="padding:14px 12px;color:white;font-weight:600;">❌ Not offered</td>
              <td style="padding:14px 12px;color:white;font-weight:600;">✅ Yes, descriptions, virtual staging and listing video are core products</td>
            </tr>
            <tr style="border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);background:rgba(255,255,255,0.02);">
              <td style="padding:14px 12px;color:white;font-weight:600;">Works With the CRM You Already Pay For</td>
              <td style="padding:14px 12px;color:white;font-weight:600;">⚠️ We install a Notion CRM for agents, included free</td>
              <td style="padding:14px 12px;color:white;font-weight:600;">✅ Yes, 250+ integrations, sits on top of Follow Up Boss, kvCORE, HubSpot</td>
            </tr>
            <tr style="border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);">
              <td style="padding:14px 12px;color:white;font-weight:600;">Who Owns What You Paid For</td>
              <td style="padding:14px 12px;color:white;font-weight:600;">✅ Your CRM, your list and your website code, yours forever</td>
              <td style="padding:14px 12px;color:white;font-weight:600;">⚠️ The agent is rented, access ends when the subscription ends</td>
            </tr>
            <tr style="border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);background:rgba(255,255,255,0.02);">
              <td style="padding:14px 12px;color:white;font-weight:600;">IDX Website and MLS Listing Search</td>
              <td style="padding:14px 12px;color:white;font-weight:600;">❌ Not an MLS platform, no listing search</td>
              <td style="padding:14px 12px;color:white;font-weight:600;">❌ No, its own comparison calls it riding on your existing IDX</td>
            </tr>
            <tr style="border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);">
              <td style="padding:14px 12px;color:white;font-weight:600;">Lead Generation</td>
              <td style="padding:14px 12px;color:white;font-weight:600;">✅ Verified, enriched, scored prospect list you own ($497 / $997 one-time)</td>
              <td style="padding:14px 12px;color:white;font-weight:600;">❌ No leads supplied, it works the leads you already have</td>
            </tr>
            <tr style="border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);background:rgba(255,255,255,0.02);">
              <td style="padding:14px 12px;color:white;font-weight:600;">Team and Brokerage Plans</td>
              <td style="padding:14px 12px;color:white;font-weight:600;">✅ Business tier from $2,997 one-time, not priced per seat</td>
              <td style="padding:14px 12px;color:white;font-weight:600;">❌ Single-agent only today, each agent subscribes separately</td>
            </tr>
            <tr style="border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);">
              <td style="padding:14px 12px;color:white;font-weight:600;">Usage Metering</td>
              <td style="padding:14px 12px;color:white;font-weight:600;">✅ None, the build runs without an action counter</td>
              <td style="padding:14px 12px;color:white;font-weight:600;">⚠️ Plans are sized by monthly actions, top-ups in $5 increments</td>
            </tr>
            <tr style="border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);background:rgba(255,255,255,0.02);">
              <td style="padding:14px 12px;color:white;font-weight:600;">Setup Time</td>
              <td style="padding:14px 12px;color:white;font-weight:600;">✅ Live in 2 to 3 days, we build it for you</td>
              <td style="padding:14px 12px;color:white;font-weight:600;">✅ Connect Gmail and calendar in about five minutes for Level 1</td>
            </tr>
            <tr style="border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);">
              <td style="padding:14px 12px;color:white;font-weight:600;">Bilingual (EN / ES)</td>
              <td style="padding:14px 12px;color:white;font-weight:600;">✅ Included, agent and website both</td>
              <td style="padding:14px 12px;color:white;font-weight:600;">⚠️ English-language workflow, drafts in your own voice</td>
            </tr>
            <tr style="border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);background:rgba(255,255,255,0.02);">
              <td style="padding:14px 12px;color:white;font-weight:600;">Independent Review Base</td>
              <td style="padding:14px 12px;color:white;font-weight:600;">⚠️ Smaller, newer studio, no large review count yet</td>
              <td style="padding:14px 12px;color:white;font-weight:600;">⚠️ G2's 4.9/5 is 7 reviews of a 2024 B2B product, Capterra shows 0</td>
            </tr>
            <tr style="border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);">
              <td style="padding:14px 12px;color:white;font-weight:600;">Support</td>
              <td style="padding:14px 12px;color:white;font-weight:600;">✅ The person who built it answers, plus optional care plans</td>
              <td style="padding:14px 12px;color:white;font-weight:600;">⚠️ Email, help desk and knowledge base, no review base to judge it on</td>
            </tr>
            <tr style="border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);background:rgba(255,255,255,0.02);">
              <td style="padding:14px 12px;color:white;font-weight:600;">Who Is It For</td>
              <td style="padding:14px 12px;color:white;font-weight:600;">Agents and small businesses losing leads to missed calls and messages</td>
