        <p style="color:var(--bs-text);line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:16px;">
          BirkyStudio is not software you log into and work. It is an operator that runs in the background. The Base Agent ($1,297 solo, from $2,997 for a team) reads every website and WhatsApp enquiry, sorts it, saves it to a Notion CRM built for agents, answers it instantly, and follows up automatically, in English and Spanish. The CRM is included free, so you are not paying a subscription for a database, and there is no action counter watching how much it runs.
        </p>
        <p style="color:var(--bs-text);line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:16px;">
          Add the AI Receptionist and the front desk is covered around the clock. The Text Receptionist for WhatsApp is $297 one-time and holds real conversations. The Voice Receptionist is $550 one-time plus Vapi usage of about $30 to $50 a month, and it answers calls 24/7 in both languages. Add a Verified Prospect List ($497 Starter, $997 Pro, one-time) and you start from real, enriched, scored prospects you own forever, no bots and no dead numbers. The $1,997 Lead Generation Pack ties it together: the list, automated outreach, an AI agent trained on your pitch, and the receptionist that catches every reply.
        </p>
        <p style="color:var(--bs-text);line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:16px;">
          Websites are the other half of what we sell, and they are deliberately the opposite of a platform: Starter $499 for 1 to 3 pages, Professional $999 for a 4 to 7 page bilingual site, Premium $1,999 for 10+ pages with a blog, all one-time, delivered in days, on your own account with the code in your hands. There is a $130 CMS add-on if you want to edit it yourself. What we do not have is the productivity layer B.Claw excels at. We do not draft your email replies for one-tap approval, we do not pull comps into a branded CMA, we do not write your listing descriptions at the push of a button, and we do not run a 6:30am briefing across your whole pipeline. If that is the work that is drowning you, B.Claw is the better product for it and we say so in the How to Choose section below.
