            <p style="color:white;font-weight:600;font-size:0.9rem;margin-bottom:8px;">Cons</p>
            <ul style="color:var(--bs-text);line-height:1.8;padding-left:20px;">
              <li>Does not answer phone calls or WhatsApp conversations</li>
              <li>You must work the draft queue for it to deliver value</li>
              <li>Subscription forever, $1,188 to $7,188 a year, every year</li>
