              <li>Single-agent only, no shared inbox or brokerage tier yet</li>
              <li>Plans metered by monthly actions, busy months cost more</li>
              <li>No IDX website and no leads supplied</li>
              <li>No meaningful independent review base for the real estate product</li>
              <li>Young company, roadmap items such as team tiers not shipping</li>
