e from 2024 and describe a general B2B prospecting and messaging product rather than today's real estate workflow, while Capterra, TrustRadius and GetApp show no written user reviews for the real estate listing. The independent assessment quoted in the detailed review, that G2's small review base describes a 2024 general B2B prospecting product and is not clear evidence for today's B.Claw real-estate workflows, is from a third party review profile checked on 12 November 2026. BirkyStudio pricing from birkystudio.com as of November 2026, including The Base Agent ($1,297 solo / from $2,997 business, Notion CRM included), the Text Receptionist ($297 one-time), the Voice Receptionist ($550 one-time plus Vapi usage of about $30 to $50 a month), the Verified Prospect List ($497 Starter / $997 Pro one-time), the Lead Generation Pack ($1,997 one-time), websites ($499 / $999 / $1,999), the CMS add-on ($130), the Custom Assessment ($349 solo / $999 business) and optional care at $97 or $197 a month. All prices were checked in November 2026 and may change; confirm current figures with each vendor before you buy.
